      <h1 id="stage-18-chunking-and-output" class="group scroll-mt-20">Stage 18: Chunking and output<a href="#stage-18-chunking-and-output" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-pagefind-ignore>&para;</a></h1>
